### Does merging PR #11412 change main at all?

$ git merge-tree --write-tree origin/main pr11412-head
35a388f06e528fc920ea89394f01e71683f8531b

$ git rev-parse origin/main^{tree}
35a388f06e528fc920ea89394f01e71683f8531b

  ==> merged tree IS main's tree, byte for byte.
  ==> merging #11412 is a NO-OP: #11406 (3a75f37ef5) already landed this fix.

